# excalidraw-app

This package is the full product shell around `@excalidraw/excalidraw`. Prefer keeping **app-only** concerns here; core editor behavior belongs in `packages/excalidraw/`.

## Boundaries

- Import the public API of packages where possible; avoid deep imports into `packages/excalidraw` internals unless already established in this repo.
- App routing, hosting config (Vite), analytics, collaboration UI, and deployment-specific code live under `excalidraw-app/`.

## Vite and env

- Use `import.meta.env` for build-time configuration; document new `VITE_*` variables for local setup.
- Do not ship secrets in client bundles — anything prefixed for the client is visible in the browser.

## Styling and UI

- Match existing layout and component patterns in the app; reuse shared styles/components before adding parallel systems.

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD — app feature colocated
// excalidraw-app/components/MyPanel.tsx

// ❌ BAD — duplicating core editor logic that belongs in packages/excalidraw
```

## How to verify

- `yarn test:typecheck` and, when tests exist for the area, `yarn test:app` (see `.cursor/rules/testing.mdc` for all scripts).
- Run the Vite dev server for `excalidraw-app` and **manually** smoke-test routing, env-driven features, and any UI you changed.
- Confirm new `VITE_*` variables are documented and that no secrets ship in client bundles.
